[Negotiation menu on knockout (test v1)]
author=Claude for Daniel
description=When you knock out a non-boss enemy in story mode, the game normally plays a short after-KO talk (Battle_StartTalk kind 1). This turns it into the threaten talk (kind 0), so the RECRUIT/ROB/INTERROGATE/BEATDOWN menu opens, but only when that enemy shows a Pride bar (Battle_PrideHudShown 0x002E3A20, which also rules out group fights). The knocked-out enemy's Pride is set to 0 first. Hook at 0x002DE478, code cave 0x003E0168-0x003E017C (after the Chester cave, so both can be on). Untested. See docs/PLAN-auto-negotiation.md.
patch=1,EE,203E0168,extended,03E0882D
patch=1,EE,203E016C,extended,0C0B8E88
patch=1,EE,203E0170,extended,00000000
patch=1,EE,203E0174,extended,0220F82D
